{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"Hensel 环"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Hensel环"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>Hensel 环是 Nisnevich 拓扑意义下的局部环, 而严格 Hensel 环是"},{"Local":{"url":"平展景","text":"平展拓扑"}},{"Plain":"意义下的局部环.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p><strong>Hensel 环</strong>是使得如下 <strong>Hensel 引理</strong>成立的"},{"Local":{"url":"局部环","text":"局部环"}},{"Plain":" $(R,\\mathfrak m)$, $k=R/\\mathfrak m$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对任意首一多项式 $f\\in R[x]$, 以及 $\\bar f\\in k[x]$ 的分解 $\\bar f = g_0 h_0$ ($g_0,h_0$ 为互素的首一多项式), 有 $f$ 的分解 $f=gh$, 使得 $\\bar g = g_0, \\bar h = h_0$, 且 $g,h$ 互素.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>若剩余域 $k$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"可分闭域","text":"可分闭域"}},{"Plain":", 则称 $R$ 为<strong>严格 Hensel 环</strong>.</p>\n"}]}}